{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50921","headline":"登纠峯顶 · 吕从庆","name":"登纠峯顶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘盘纠峯岭，不与羣峯同。\n我来值清秋，落叶飞苍穹。\n洪涛湃松柏，烟雨交空蒙。\n爱兹竟忘返，非关足力穷。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}